<%- include('../partials/_layout-top') %>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container" style="max-width:800px;">
    <h1>Refund &amp; Return Policy</h1>
    <p class="muted">Last updated: <%= new Date().toLocaleDateString('en-IN', { year: 'numeric', month: 'long' }) %></p>

    <h3>1. Order Cancellation</h3>
    <p>You may cancel an order by contacting us at <a href="mailto:<%= settings.email %>"><%= settings.email %></a> or <%= settings.phone %> as soon as possible after placing it. Orders that have already been packed or shipped cannot be cancelled, but may still be eligible for return once delivered - see below.</p>

    <h3>2. Damaged, Defective or Incorrect Items</h3>
    <p>If an item arrives damaged, defective, or different from what you ordered, please contact us within 3 days of delivery at <a href="mailto:<%= settings.email %>"><%= settings.email %></a> or <%= settings.phone %>, along with your Order ID and a photo of the item. We will arrange a replacement or a refund, at our discretion, once the issue is verified.</p>

    <h3>3. Returns</h3>
    <p>Because most items in our shop are pooja essentials, books, clothing and jewellery replicas intended for personal or ritual use, we generally do not accept returns for a change of mind once an item has been delivered in good condition. Returns are accepted only for damaged, defective or incorrect items as described above.</p>

    <h3>4. Donations</h3>
    <p>Donations made through this website are voluntary contributions towards the temple's activities, maintenance and upkeep, and are non-refundable once processed, except where required by law or in the case of a genuine payment error as described below. If you made a donation in error - for example, an incorrect amount or a duplicate payment - please contact us within 7 days of the transaction with your payment reference number, and we will review the matter and arrange a refund where appropriate.</p>

    <h3>5. Payment Errors &amp; Duplicate Charges</h3>
    <p>If you believe a payment (for an order or a donation) was made in error - for example, a duplicate charge, an incorrect amount due to a technical issue, or a payment that did not complete but money was deducted from your account - please contact us within 7 days of the transaction with your Order ID or donation reference and payment details (available in your payment confirmation from Razorpay, or your bank/UPI app for direct UPI or bank transfer payments).</p>

    <h3>6. Refund Processing</h3>
    <p>Approved refunds for orders or donations are processed back to the original payment method (via Razorpay for card/UPI-through-Razorpay payments, or by bank transfer/UPI for direct payments) and typically reflect as per Razorpay's and your bank's standard processing timelines, usually within 5-10 business days.</p>

    <h3>7. Contact</h3>
    <p>For any order, donation or payment-related concern, reach out to us at <a href="mailto:<%= settings.email %>"><%= settings.email %></a> or via the <a href="/contact">Contact page</a>.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<%- include('../partials/_layout-bottom') %>
